message: "If you use Creative Companion in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Creative Companion"
authors:
  - family-names: "Huang"
    given-names: "Yike"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/yike-huang/creative-companion"
url: "https://github.com/yike-huang/creative-companion"
license: "MIT"
version: "0.1.0"
abstract: "Creative Companion is an AI-powered website for personalized, art-inspired, non-clinical emotional support for cancer patients and survivors. It supports private emotional reflection, AI-assisted emotion pattern summaries, personalized creative coping activity recommendations, artwork creation and upload, and crisis resource display while emphasizing consent, safety boundaries, and non-clinical use."
keywords:
  - "cancer survivorship"
  - "emotional support"
  - "creative coping"
  - "art-inspired activities"
  - "human-centered AI"
  - "retrieval-augmented generation"
  - "digital health"
